### ============================================================
### M1 — Autentikasi
### ============================================================

### Login ADMIN (200 — cookie HttpOnly diterbitkan)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nidn": "9999999001",
  "password": "LppmDemo123!"
}

### Password salah (401 — pesan sama dengan NIDN tak dikenal, mencegah enumerasi)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nidn": "9999999001",
  "password": "salah"
}

### NIDN bukan teks (400 — ditolak Zod sebelum menyentuh database)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nidn": 123,
  "password": "x"
}

### Sesi aktif (200)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Tanpa sesi (401 UNAUTHENTICATED)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
X-Ignore-Auth: true

### ============================================================
### M8 — Master Data
### ============================================================

### Daftar program studi (200 — hanya ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/prodi
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Daftar periode akademik (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/periode
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Konfigurasi field dinamis KKN (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/form-field?jenis=KKN
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Jenis di luar enum skema (400 VALIDATION)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/form-field?jenis=PKM
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### ============================================================
### M2 — Proposal & Tim
### ============================================================

### Daftar proposal milik dosen (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Buat proposal KKN — field wajib terisi (201)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

{
  "judul": "Kajian Dampak Sosial Program KKN Angkatan 41",
  "jenis": "KKN",
  "programStudiId": "3e374d05-2868-4e9e-b4d8-879d6442c489",
  "periodeId": "ID_PERIODE_AKTIF",
  "fieldTambahan": {
    "Desa Sasaran": "Sumberejo"
  }
}

### Buat proposal — field wajib "Desa Sasaran" kosong (400 VALIDATION)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

{
  "judul": "Kajian Dampak Sosial Program KKN Angkatan 41",
  "jenis": "KKN",
  "programStudiId": "3e374d05-2868-4e9e-b4d8-879d6442c489",
  "periodeId": "ID_PERIODE_AKTIF"
}

### Field tidak terdaftar di konfigurasi M8 (400 VALIDATION)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

{
  "judul": "Kajian Dampak Sosial Program KKN Angkatan 41",
  "jenis": "KKN",
  "programStudiId": "3e374d05-2868-4e9e-b4d8-879d6442c489",
  "periodeId": "ID_PERIODE_AKTIF",
  "fieldTambahan": {
    "Desa Sasaran": "Sumberejo",
    "KolomRahasia": "harus ditolak"
  }
}

### Tambah anggota tim (201)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/ID_PROPOSAL/anggota
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

{
  "nidn": "0412345681"
}

### Anggota duplikat (409 CONFLICT)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/ID_PROPOSAL/anggota
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

{
  "nidn": "0412345681"
}

### Submit — kirim ke Kaprodi (200)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/ID_PROPOSAL/submit
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Submit dua kali (409 TRANSISI_TIDAK_SAHIH)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/ID_PROPOSAL/submit
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Detail proposal + riwayat verifikasi (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/ID_PROPOSAL
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### ============================================================
### M3 — Verifikasi & Review (Tie-Breaker)
### ============================================================

### Verifikasi tahap Kaprodi — SETUJUI (200)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2995014c-2214-4bca-829b-994e3a527a37/verifikasi
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusan": "SETUJUI"
}

### REVISI tanpa catatan (403 — catatan wajib)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2995014c-2214-4bca-829b-994e3a527a37/verifikasi
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusan": "REVISI"
}

### Keputusan di luar enum (400 — ditolak Zod)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2995014c-2214-4bca-829b-994e3a527a37/verifikasi
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusan": "SETUJU"
}

### Penugasan Reviewer 1 & 2 (201)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/5f9f44cc-c9d8-4931-864a-fce8a7fe48c7/reviewer
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewer": [
    { "urutanReviewer": 1, "nidn": "0412345682" },
    { "urutanReviewer": 2, "nidn": "0412345683" }
  ]
}

### Pengusul jadi reviewer (409 — konflik kepentingan)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/5f9f44cc-c9d8-4931-864a-fce8a7fe48c7/reviewer
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewer": [
    { "urutanReviewer": 1, "nidn": "0412345680" },
    { "urutanReviewer": 2, "nidn": "0412345683" }
  ]
}

### Tampilan blind reviewer (200 — TANPA nilai reviewer lain)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/5f9f44cc-c9d8-4931-864a-fce8a7fe48c7/review
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Ajukan nilai (200 — memicu tie-breaker bila kedua reviewer selesai)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/5f9f44cc-c9d8-4931-864a-fce8a7fe48c7/review
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skor": 85,
  "rekomendasi": "TERIMA",
  "catatan": "Inovasi tinggi, relevan dengan kebutuhan daerah."
}

### Keputusan rapat offline — skenario sengketa (200)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/fca0a2cf-1627-420b-806e-c14c2f8ff2c7/keputusan
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusanAkhir": "LOLOS",
  "catatan": "Rapat 29 Okt: inovasi dinilai menutupi kelemahan anggaran."
}

### Putusan kedua ditolak (409 — status sudah keluar dari PERLU_KEPUTUSAN)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/fca0a2cf-1627-420b-806e-c14c2f8ff2c7/keputusan
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keputusanAkhir": "DITOLAK"
}

### ============================================================
### M4 — Penerbitan Dokumen SK & ST
### ============================================================

### Sumber dana — nilai di luar enum (400)
PUT {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/sumber-dana
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sumberDana": "HAIB"
}

### Isi sumber dana menjelang cetak (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/sumber-dana
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sumberDana": "EKSTERNAL"
}

### Terbitkan ST sebelum SK (409 — urutan wajib)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/dokumen
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jenis": "ST"
}

### Terbitkan SK — penomoran otomatis (201)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/dokumen
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jenis": "SK"
}

### SK ganda ditolak (409)
POST {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/dokumen
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jenis": "SK"
}

### Status dokumen proposal (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/2093cc76-61f3-4f46-8030-3122ccafd701/dokumen
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### ============================================================
### M7 & M9 — Notifikasi & Log Aktivitas
### ============================================================

### Daftar notifikasi + jumlah belum dibaca (200)
GET {{host}}/api/notifikasi
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Tandai satu notifikasi sudah dibaca (200)
POST {{host}}/api/notifikasi/f57567fd-0300-488f-843e-f6bf01063405/baca
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Tandai semua notifikasi sudah dibaca (200)
POST {{host}}/api/notifikasi/baca-semua
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Timeline riwayat proposal — ketua pengusul (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/0d833998-06ac-4979-a894-491eb1cd85a8/riwayat
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Jejak audit global (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### ============================================================
### M5 — Rekap Eksekutif, Drill-down & Export
### ============================================================

### Daftar periode akademik untuk filter (200)
GET {{host}}/api/rekap/periode
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Rekap eksekutif — seluruh prodi (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/rekap
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Drill-down: klik angka "Lolos" -> daftar proposal (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/rekap/rincian?dimensi=status&nilai=Lolos
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### ============================================================
### M6 — Konten Publik
### ============================================================

### Daftar berita (khusus ADMIN, semua status) (200)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/berita
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Berita publik — hanya yang TERBIT (200, tanpa login)
GET {{host}}/api/public/berita

### Galeri publik (200, tanpa login)
GET {{host}}/api/public/galeri

### ============================================================
### Fase 9 — Kuisioner Publik & Uji RBAC
### ============================================================

### Daftar kuisioner AKTIF (200, tanpa login)
GET {{host}}/api/public/kuisioner

### Kirim jawaban sah (200, tanpa login)
POST {{host}}/api/public/kuisioner/{{kuisId}}/isi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "namaPengisi": "Budi Santoso",
  "jawaban": { "q1": "4", "q2": "Kejelasan informasi", "q3": "Tolong upload panduan PDF." }
}

### Jawaban untuk pertanyaan yang tidak ada (400 PERTANYAAN_TIDAK_DIKENAL)
POST {{host}}/api/public/kuisioner/{{kuisId}}/isi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "namaPengisi": "Anonim", "jawaban": { "q99": "x" } }

### Pertanyaan wajib yang kosong (400 JAWABAN_WAJIB_KOSONG)
POST {{host}}/api/public/kuisioner/{{kuisId}}/isi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "namaPengisi": "Anonim", "jawaban": { "q1": "5" } }

### Kuisioner SELESAI tidak menerima jawaban (404, bukan 403)
POST {{host}}/api/public/kuisioner/{{kuisSelesai}}/isi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "namaPengisi": "Anonim", "jawaban": { "q1": "5", "q2": "SOP" } }

### ============================================================
### RBAC — siapa boleh membaca proposal
### ============================================================

### ADMIN membaca semua proposal (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}

### KETUA_STIKOM pengawasan institusional (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}

### KETUA_LPPM pengawasan institusional (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}

### PRODI tidak berhak membaca proposal (403 FORBIDDEN)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}
Cookie: lppm_token={{tokenProdi}}

### DOSEN lain bukan pemilik (403 FORBIDDEN)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}
Cookie: lppm_token={{tokenDosenLain}}

### DOSEN pemilik proposal (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}

### REVIEWER yang ditugaskan (200)
GET {{host}}/api/proposal/{{proposalId}}

### ============================================================
### RBAC — DELETE id yang tidak dikenal
### ============================================================

### Hapus program studi dengan id tak dikenal (404 NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/prodi/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}

### Hapus periode dengan id tak dikenal (404 NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/periode/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Cookie: lppm_token={{token}}
